Hello all,

Thanks for a great first year of D-RUG! I'd like to hear what has worked and what hasn't from all of you so as to make D-RUG more useful to more people next year. Please fill out this short survey so I can incorporate your feedback.

Please note that you can fill out the survey even if you've never attended a D-RUG session. In fact, I'd especially like to hear from those that haven't.

Cheers,

Noam
