It looks like there might not be any matching "Gene" values between the two. Check by using sum(Dsuz$Gene%in% fkpm$Gene) to count how many matches there are. If you add all=TRUE to the merge command you can get an "outer" join, which will include ALL, not just matching, records. If there are supposed to be matching "Gene" values, maybe there's a formatting difference between the two files, like trailing spaces after the values in the "Gene" column.

